{"pull": {"id": "number:22009", "number": 22009, "title": "MINOR: Add a new interface `TimeOrderedStore` to refactor the `isTimeOrderedStore` method", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-04-09T13:26:58Z", "closed_at": "2026-04-09T15:37:20Z", "merged_at": null, "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Currently, `TimestampedWindowStoreWithHeadersBuilder#isTimeOrderedStore`\nrelies on hardcoded `instanceof` checks for specific adapter classes\n(e.g., `TimestampedToHeadersWindowStoreAdapter`), which is a workaround\nthat is not maintainable. This PR introduces a new `TimeOrderedStore`\ninterface that all time-ordered stores and their adapters implement.\nThis makes the check more generic, type-safe, and extensible.\n", "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/streams", "name": "streams", "color": "63edea", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id"